Subject: [PATCH 51/55] media: rkisp1: Add and set registers for output size config on i.MX8MP
Date: Wed, 15 Jun 2022 04:11:23 +0900
Message-Id: <20220614191127.3420492-52-paul.elder@ideasonboard.com>
